  "51e4dffc-d38f-5703-079b-d6b9e63a3a69"],
 " is a generalized Laguerre polynomial. The complete Wigner function is \
then"
}], "Text",
 CellID->2102744249,ExpressionUUID->"30e43b5d-74af-d0fb-609b-b3077d5ba2c1"],

Cell[BoxData[
 PaneBox[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["W", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["(",
